WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,330
Why do you arrest me?

2
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:02,610
What happened to me taking the ID photo?

3
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,210
That law stipulates that you can't take pictures

4
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:05,210
Since he is real

5
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,370
Then why not give it to the common people?

6
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:08,180
Told you

7
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,300
Now follow us back to the bureau

8
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,820
Some things are not just what you say

9
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,140
Do you know you broke the law?

10
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,060
Nowadays, more and more people are jumping up the ranks

11
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:25,350
We can't delay it any longer, sir.

12
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,670
We go around from the side

13
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:28,110
Okay, I listen to you all

14
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:37,560
I said I am a member of the state, why can’t I?
